### CALL target formula: two call sites -> same target (target=call+4+off40)
  call@+0x24 off40=-104  target(call+4+off40)=-64
  twocall out: [5.0, 9.0, 13.0, 17.0] expect A+2B= [5, 9, 13, 17]

### off40 is load-bearing: corrupt the target -> fault/wrong
  baseline helper2=A*B+1: [21.0, 31.0, 41.0, 51.0] expect [21, 31, 41, 51]
  off40 byte+7 0x98->0x9a : status=OK out=[0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0]
    recovery: OK
  off40 byte+7 0x98->0xa8 : status=HANG out=-
    recovery: OK

